<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets 150 bln lira five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets 150 bln lira five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Credit Italiano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIT   SPREAD     +0.375    MATURITY    05.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.625</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.75</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.375</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
